  "description": "The Atlas Disc evolves the original 24” Atlas by introducing the added precision and reliability of a disc brake system. It’s designed for riders who want more control across every environment—trails, pump tracks, and city streets alike. Retaining its race-inspired geometry and full 24” wheel setup, the Atlas Disc also features components like the Wethepeople Patrol stem and 33t sprocket, tying back to its racing heritage while embracing modern functionality. The Glossy Blue finish keeps the look clean and minimal, while the braking upgrade enhances real-world performance. A bike built for versatility, speed, and repeat rides—the Atlas Disc is hard to walk away from once you’ve tried it.",
